        <detaileddescription>
<para>Where the model ended up. Never <computeroutput>Auto</computeroutput>, and <bold>not</bold> an echo of the request: an unsatisfiable <computeroutput>Vram</computeroutput> reports <computeroutput>Ram</computeroutput>, and a model already resident under a different placement reports the resident value — placement is fixed at load time and is deliberately not part of the server&apos;s model cache key, so the first loader wins. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
